    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83c\udf46If you like guys...and the girls too!\ud83c\udf51</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/9a213465c8e3ff7b4e99fbdc0ecc0d6b.poster.avif?t=1750756659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/9a213465c8e3ff7b4e99fbdc0ecc0d6b.webm?t=1750756659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Furry Shades of Gay 3: Still Gayer continues the epic saga of furry men loving other furry men with new stories, new characters and other new things! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/edcd67d77a4de49c25964da91d52c2a0.poster.avif?t=1750756659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/edcd67d77a4de49c25964da91d52c2a0.webm?t=1750756659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sex will get even hotter with new, much longer and more varied animations. All the thrusts and tugs and jerks and stretches are more expressive now and our animators are having an absolute blast with them. And for the first time in the series all the animations will have voice acting and sound effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/65109e6e6dfa722894f3431381b11772.poster.avif?t=1750756659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/65109e6e6dfa722894f3431381b11772.webm?t=1750756659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The puzzle engine is getting another upgrade as well. New goals, new obstacles, and new themed levels await you! Plow through all the targets and you\u2019ll get to see your favourite characters plow each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/08abb92805971bcc2e163e6a92d91641.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>Percy and Blake are looking for a love nest to call their own. While on search, they stumble upon an old Victorian mansion and decide to take a closer look. To their surprise, the door has locked behind them, so they have to delve deep into the mystery\u2026 Ghosts don\u2019t exist after all, do they?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/85ad55273f36aced4bc565152197cee3.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>There are still a few days left from the work trip, and Alex is bored in his room alone. Italy always reminds him of Valentino and the spark that ran between them in college. Well, the phone call is made and Alex is on his way to his own hot Italian adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/82a1c58280716d0b691727c5f6089fb2.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>Hugo is a work procrastination legend. He spends his time chatting with a very hot stranger who just adores his round ass, on his phone. But what happens if his boss William catches him? He's not going to fire Hugo, is he?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/bd72ac319b2d33a9259fb2f72d101c15.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>Summer is coming to an end, and the shift at the scout camp is ending, too. Connor feels a little sad for the days gone by, and does he\u2026 feel something for Dan? But Dan is also a guy... It seems he doesn't seem to care as much as Connor, who is trying to sort himself out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/a837deb5b908552928791cb57ef083f3.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>Millennial Maiki has millennial problems - his back hurts. His masseuse, Adele, unfortunately has a day off, but promises to come up with something to help with his urgent request. And it seems that her \u201csomething\u201d is already knocking on Maiki's door to save his tense muscles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/609ef67e64c6f13402dfa6afbf6a8e2d.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>It\u2019s been a while since Evan crossed the threshold of Snake\u2019s Pit BDSM club. His relationship with his Master, Snake, has greatly evolved in the past months, no longer resembling a simple professional bond. Valentine\u2019s Day is coming\u2026 Will both of them be able to confess that they have grown to be much closer to each other?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five all new, even gayer stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 60 fully original artworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Longer animated sex scenes with sound and voiceovers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching narrative, hard choices, sloppy rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updated Match-3 gameplay with new goals and features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Furry Shades of Gay 3: Still Gayer continues the epic saga of furry men loving other furry men with new stories, new characters and other new things! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/edcd67d77a4de49c25964da91d52c2a0.poster.avif?t=1750756659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/edcd67d77a4de49c25964da91d52c2a0.webm?t=1750756659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sex will get even hotter with new, much longer and more varied animations. All the thrusts and tugs and jerks and stretches are more expressive now and our animators are having an absolute blast with them. And for the first time in the series all the animations will have voice acting and sound effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/65109e6e6dfa722894f3431381b11772.poster.avif?t=1750756659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/65109e6e6dfa722894f3431381b11772.webm?t=1750756659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The puzzle engine is getting another upgrade as well. New goals, new obstacles, and new themed levels await you! Plow through all the targets and you\u2019ll get to see your favourite characters plow each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/08abb92805971bcc2e163e6a92d91641.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>Percy and Blake are looking for a love nest to call their own. While on search, they stumble upon an old Victorian mansion and decide to take a closer look. To their surprise, the door has locked behind them, so they have to delve deep into the mystery\u2026 Ghosts don\u2019t exist after all, do they?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/85ad55273f36aced4bc565152197cee3.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>There are still a few days left from the work trip, and Alex is bored in his room alone. Italy always reminds him of Valentino and the spark that ran between them in college. Well, the phone call is made and Alex is on his way to his own hot Italian adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/82a1c58280716d0b691727c5f6089fb2.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>Hugo is a work procrastination legend. He spends his time chatting with a very hot stranger who just adores his round ass, on his phone. But what happens if his boss William catches him? He's not going to fire Hugo, is he?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/bd72ac319b2d33a9259fb2f72d101c15.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>Summer is coming to an end, and the shift at the scout camp is ending, too. Connor feels a little sad for the days gone by, and does he\u2026 feel something for Dan? But Dan is also a guy... It seems he doesn't seem to care as much as Connor, who is trying to sort himself out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/a837deb5b908552928791cb57ef083f3.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>Millennial Maiki has millennial problems - his back hurts. His masseuse, Adele, unfortunately has a day off, but promises to come up with something to help with his urgent request. And it seems that her \u201csomething\u201d is already knocking on Maiki's door to save his tense muscles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953540/extras/609ef67e64c6f13402dfa6afbf6a8e2d.avif?t=1750756659\" /></div>It\u2019s been a while since Evan crossed the threshold of Snake\u2019s Pit BDSM club. His relationship with his Master, Snake, has greatly evolved in the past months, no longer resembling a simple professional bond. Valentine\u2019s Day is coming\u2026 Will both of them be able to confess that they have grown to be much closer to each other?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five all new, even gayer stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 60 fully original artworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Longer animated sex scenes with sound and voiceovers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching narrative, hard choices, sloppy rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updated Match-3 gameplay with new goals and features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>",
